# 🌐 Network Design

## VPC

| Parameter       | Value         |
| --------------- | ------------- |
| CIDR            | `10.1.0.0/16` |
| Region          | `us-east-1`   |
| Public Subnets  | 2             |
| Private Subnets | 2             |

The VPC was divided into multiple network segments to separate Internet-facing infrastructure from internal resources.

---

## Subnets

| Subnet           | CIDR          | Type    |
| ---------------- | ------------- | ------- |
| Public Subnet A  | `10.1.1.0/24` | Public  |
| Public Subnet B  | `10.1.2.0/24` | Public  |
| Private Subnet A | `10.1.3.0/24` | Private |
| Private Subnet B | `10.1.4.0/24` | Private |

The architecture was designed with multiple Availability Zones in mind to provide a foundation for future high-availability implementations.

